WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.640
Did the university send you?

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.720
Because if they did, they can get lost.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:27.620
I have never been so insulted in all my life.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:28.940
Really? Laughed at?

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:32.540
Wolderdash, are you quite certain you're not a spy?

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.380
Those wretches will do anything to destroy me.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.200
My theories are correct, and I can prove it.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.600
What are you doing?

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.760
I am the leading amateur paleontologist in the nation,

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.060
and not one university will hire me,

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.080
because unlike them, I actually have ideas.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:55.740
You're a what?

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.000
I study dinosaurs.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
You know, big lizards.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.160
Are they real?

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.500
Of course they're real, you snig-cum-poop.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.000
And everywhere...

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.500
Everywhere?

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.840
This state was once a vast, shallow sea

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:15.440
that had the most incredible animal

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:18.180
that could walk, swim, and fly.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:19.620
Quite unique.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.160
I call it Totalis Horus.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.300
Just for now.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:27.860
I'm trying to gather all these animals.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.000
I'm trying to find the evidence.

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:31.540
This Deborah McGinnis.

00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:32.500
Arthur.

00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:33.540
Good to meet you.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:35.140
Could you give me a hand here, please?

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.280
Of course.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:37.400
Yeah.

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:38.540
Listen.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:41.680
If you find any of these bones around the country,

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.980
send them to my homestead

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.920
at Firwood Rise in Cumberland Forest.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.760
Or mail me the locations.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.760
I'll reward you handsomely for your efforts.

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:57.100
Sure. Why not?

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:57.960
And wait.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.700
I will be proving a lot of stuck-up buffoons

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.540
very, very wrong.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:07.680
Which, trust me, is the very best thing about science.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.680
Good day to you, sir.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.300
Did they not inside you?

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.760
Yep.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:31.460
Yep.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:31.940
Did they not inside you?

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:32.400
Yep.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.480
And Application center

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:34.540
can go anywhere.

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.240
Yes sir.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.300
I'm going down here now.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:36.700
OK.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.600
Strawberry boy,

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:38.180
but one,

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:38.900
With your gear.

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:39.680
And�

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:49.540
Pull up,

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:50.680
you can't go in there.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.620
Yes sir.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:54.960
Hell yeah, baby.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.520
You got a grab bag with you.

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:57.800
Oh, man.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:15.260
You're alright, boy. Hold on.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:36.920
Okay, boy. Let's go.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:52.040
Please set me up! I'm an innocent man!

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:54.960
Hey, enough out of you.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.980
Stay back from the wagon.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.640
I'm an innocent man, sir. Transporting a fugitive.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:04.480
Hey! Hey, you! Please! You gotta get me out of here!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.720
Let me out of here! I got a wife and kids!

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:10.760
Shut up and keep still!

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:10.840
Shut up!

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:29.560
I never robbed a thing in all my life! Come on!

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:32.100
Oh, you're giving me a headache!

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:33.960
Yeah!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:34.060
Yeah!

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.060
Yeah!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.680
Who goes there?

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:48.180
It's Arthur!

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.900
Welcome back, Arthur.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.800
Hey!

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:59.720
Hey!

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:03.880
Hey!

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:05.480
Hey!

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.460
Hey!

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:08.400
Hey!

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:08.620
Hey!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:08.720
Hey!

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:09.380
Hey!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:09.880
Hey!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:10.400
Hey!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:10.420
Hey!

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:10.580
Hey!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:10.800
Hey!

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:10.820
Hey!

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:10.840
Hey!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:21.160
Well, it's not the first time you've been covered in blood.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.840
I am not of the kind.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.660
Then prove it.

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.880
I apologize in advance for this stew.

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:40.500
It needs better meat.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:41.840
Thank you.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.640
Well, it's better than nothing, Pearson.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.480
Just in time, Mr. Morgan.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.720
Many thanks, Mr. Morgan.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:07.280
Arthur, don't forget, I'm more than happy to craft you something if you bring me the right materials.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:11.320
I'll be glad to.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.860
Just remember, my items are one of a kind, Mr. Morgan.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:29.780
Thanks, Pearson.

